  "content": "<p>蛋糕咀嚼模組為蛋糕添加了進食音效和碎屑粒子效果，就像吃其他食物時一樣。就是這樣簡單。</p>\n\n<h2>下載</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cake-chomps-fabric/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.16.1 - 1.19.2</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cake-chomps/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.19.3+</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cake-chomps/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NeoForge</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cake-chomps/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>支援</h2>\n<p>請將所有錯誤、問題和功能請求報告至<a href=\"https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/cakechomps/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>。</p>\n<p>非技術支援與問題，請加入開發者的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/JWgrdwt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</p>\n\n<h2>授權</h2>\n<p>所有原始碼和資源均採用LGPL 3.0授權。</p>\n\n<h2>捐款</h2>\n<p>可透過<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C1NL4O\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>向開發者捐款。</p>\n\n<h2>合作夥伴</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fillusivesoulworks.com%252faffiliate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5Tw6mh2/bisect-illusive.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>",
